    m_Localized: White Magician Foxy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73906251874951168
    m_Localized: Black Magician Foxy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385894518785
    m_Localized: Polaris
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398208
    m_Localized: Dark Wolf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635858
    m_Localized: Polar Fizz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050729951250
    m_Localized: Shapid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050729951251
    m_Localized: Turtlia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050729951252
    m_Localized: Kanade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050729951253
    m_Localized: Highnickel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385894518786
    m_Localized: Korra
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635865
    m_Localized: Throw a snowball at a distant enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635866
    m_Localized: Fire shells at enemies to cause Splash Damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635867
    m_Localized: It hits a nearby enemy and causes relatively high damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635868
    m_Localized: Grant a buff to nearby allies, increasing their attack power. (Redundant)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635869
    m_Localized: Fires a crescent-shaped object to slow down the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145536
    m_Localized: Throw an icicle at a distant enemy. Icicles cause additional damage
      in proportion to the distance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145537
    m_Localized: Kiring sacrifices his land first with a commitment to anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145538
    m_Localized: Dark Ridge fires two crescent spheres. The crescent sphere slows
      down the opponent, just like the Lazy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398209
    m_Localized: Your attack power increases according to the number of water droplets
      you possess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145539
    m_Localized: When selling a 4-star lemmingrich, you can get additional droplets.
      Also, they are hiding hidden missions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145540
    m_Localized: Basic wolf deals 2 times more critical damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145541
    m_Localized: 'If there are no allies within a space nearby, it becomes a runaway.

      In
      the event of a runaway, additional attack power and additional attack speed
      are obtained.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385894518787
    m_Localized: After a certain period of time, Darby's weapon changes. As the weapon
      changes, attack power and attack speed increase. (Limit 3 times)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145542
    m_Localized: It transforms every hour and attacks very fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145543
    m_Localized: When attacking, if the enemy's physical strength is below a certain
      level, he will kill the target with a single blow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385894518788
    m_Localized: When summoned or fused, if Kyle appears, he grants the power of
      the dragon to a random ally on the field, boosting their attack power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398210
    m_Localized: Through research, you obtain water droplets. Success in research
      grants access to acquiring more water droplets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398211
    m_Localized: Through continuous performance, provide a buff to friends within
      a cross-shaped range of 4 cells, increasing their attack speed. (Non-redundant)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145544
    m_Localized: 'launch a powerful ice structure in far distance.

      Ice concrete
      leaves a circular plate

      Monsters passing through the chapter is slow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145545
    m_Localized: Fire an electric current at the monster. Electricity is transmitted
      around the electrocuted enemy, and the attack continues until the first electrocuted
      enemy dies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145546
    m_Localized: Fire a single dark sphere, leaving a dark mark. When four dark markers
      overlap, additional damage occurs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385894518789
    m_Localized: 'After a certain period of time, it grows into one of the characters
      you''ve constructed. (Max 5 Stars)

      When it reaches 5 stars, the default
      attack is changed to a splash attack that deals spread damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398212
    m_Localized: You have a certain probability of assassinating the monster, instantly
      defeating it. Upon successful assassination, you gain an additional water droplet
      based on the probability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635870
    m_Localized: Attacks the nearest single enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145547
    m_Localized: Damage goes up every time the wave passes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145548
    m_Localized: Fire a water cannon to slow the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145549
    m_Localized: I pick things up from the sea every other cycle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145550
    m_Localized: When highnickel appears, all monsters present in the field are caught
      in the stun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385894518790
    m_Localized: You can recover the lost land after a certain wave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635859
    m_Localized: 'I am the great Pengo of the Pengo family!

      Take the snowball
      of justice!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635860
    m_Localized: Everything is bound to be equal on a single shell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635861
    m_Localized: 'Hey, kid!

      Isn''t my horn wonderful?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635862
    m_Localized: "I'm not confident in combat...\r\nCan my magic really help\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635863
    m_Localized: 'Don''t call me Lazy!

      It''s just, it''s just... annoying!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145551
    m_Localized: I'm not like that green throwing a snowball!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145552
    m_Localized: "I'm always trying for the happiness and well-being of others.\r\nBut\u2026
      why are you putting me on the edge\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145553
    m_Localized: 'Hell, I hate being busy...!

      Hey foxy!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398213
    m_Localized: Hehe, gotta be careful, so it doesn't end up rolling instead of
      swimming!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145554
    m_Localized: 'Environment? Trash? What''s so important!

      The most important
      thing is money!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145555
    m_Localized: "Wait a minute...!\r\n I got my nails done !!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145556
    m_Localized: Don't get in the way of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385898713088
    m_Localized: 'Davira, Davira!

      The undeniable charm of the unrivaled rabbit!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145557
    m_Localized: Freedom and rest... Everyone needs a place to rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145558
    m_Localized: It's a horn that's been beaten a thousand times!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385898713089
    m_Localized: 'Welcome.

      Please, have a seat and take your time if you wish
      to discuss the Dragon Stone. Here, the mighty power of the dragon guides everything
      surrounding this place.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398214
    m_Localized: I study the magic in drops. It's always a pleasure to explore the
      power of the unknown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398215
    m_Localized: Do you wanna listen to my guitar performance? You'll feel lighter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145559
    m_Localized: 'The glacier is a burden!

      Recall that breaking glaciers is
      a challenge to luggage!

      You have the honor of guarding your luggage!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145560
    m_Localized: 'Electric magic is full of bright light and energy.

      I''m
      proud to light up the surroundings and protect the glaciers and the surrounding
      environment with the power to defeat the darkness.

      House...I''m obsessed
      with it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145561
    m_Localized: 'Why protect the glacier? I''m not interested in that sort of thing.

      If
      you want help, why don''t you dye the ice black?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147575385898713090
    m_Localized: 'My hand is firm and resolute, but you''re my buddy, Pengo.

      I
      won''t lend strength to a thief'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180580003490398216
    m_Localized: I tend to do missions at night. I can see my enemy better in the
      dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2586972265635864
    m_Localized: "I... It's not a mussel\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145562
    m_Localized: 'Bang! Bang! Bang! Doo Doo Doo Doo Doo!

      How does my water
      gun taste!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050734145563
