  - m_Id: 94180050742534153
    m_Localized: Lemmingrich stole the treasures of the Pengo family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534154
    m_Localized: Use your friends' characteristics to use various strategies!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534155
    m_Localized: The performance of all characters comes at a level that matches
      the level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534156
    m_Localized: Willow! The ice is too narrow to wield a big knife.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534157
    m_Localized: Drag the same character(friends) to merge it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534158
    m_Localized: You can get an extra bonus if you have more than 50 drops!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534159
    m_Localized: Summon the boss and get him! You can get water droplets!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534160
    m_Localized: Hurry up! The ice is melting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534161
    m_Localized: If you miss a litter, the glaciers will break!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534162
    m_Localized: Polaris is the sheriff of the Pengo family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534145
    m_Localized: Get the best record and challenge the ranking!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534163
    m_Localized: Team up with unique friends and strategize!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534164
    m_Localized: Razy is always late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534165
    m_Localized: 'Join the official community through Discord

      And take part
      in various benefits and events!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534146
    m_Localized: The horns of Beosk were made by Hammering!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534147
    m_Localized: Weekly rankings are counted every Wednesday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534148
    m_Localized: Why don't you use a tumbler rather than a disposable cup?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534149
    m_Localized: Generating icicles...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534150
    m_Localized: "Fortis feels sorry for Foxy, who was ruled by black magic\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534151
    m_Localized: I'm bringing in friends to fight with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94180050742534152
    m_Localized: Pengo are a famous penguin family in Antarctica!
