      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649857
    m_Localized: After the count, trash guys will appear, so please summon us 4 times
      using <color=#5AF8FF>Water droplets!</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649866
    m_Localized: "Use <color=#5AF8FF>Water droplets</color> to <color=#FAB6FF>upgrade!</color>
      \r\nThen, We can become stronger."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649867
    m_Localized: The more characters you have, the better efficiency you'll get,
      right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649868
    m_Localized: 'Thanks! That''s the end of the game tutorial.

      Shall we check
      the <color=#C0FF9E>rewards</color> based on the rankings one last time?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649869
    m_Localized: Compete with <color=#FAB6FF>players worldwide</color> for the weekly
      top score and earn <color=#FAB6FF>various rewards</color>!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649858
    m_Localized: 'You collected <color=#5AF8FF>droplets</color> by clearing the trash!

      Summon
      more and try <color=#C0FF9E>merging</color> them!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649859
    m_Localized: '<color=#C0FF9E>You have the same character!

      </color>

      Drag
      and synthesize the two characters!

      When synthesized, stronger colleagues
      appear as <color=#FAB6FF>random</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649860
    m_Localized: Since we got a strong character, shall we summon <color=#FFA9A2>Boss
      Monster</color>?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649861
    m_Localized: 'You got <color=#5AF8FF>Water droplets</color> by killing <color=#FFA9A2>Boss
      Monster</color>

      Should we summon more friends with the water drops we
      got?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649862
    m_Localized: '<color=#C0FF9E>You cleared the mission!</color>

      There are
      other missions besides the cleared ones, so please refer to the icon on the
      upper right!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649863
    m_Localized: One more drop per <color=#C0FF9E>50</color> <color=#5AF8FF>Water
      droplets!</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649864
    m_Localized: You can play the game more strategically through <color=#FFA9A2>Boss
      Monster</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Mission</color>, <color=#C0FF9E>Interest</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649865
    m_Localized: Ugh! If you miss the trash, <color=#FFA9A2>the glaciers will disappear!</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94277592230649856
    m_Localized: Click!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
