    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 214604374313263104
    m_Localized: 'Selfish people can never cooperate.

      The result is those
      trash.

      It''s so pathetic.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 214604397084139520
    m_Localized: If there are other hives in adjacent positions, they will be in
      a connected state. The more connections there are, the greater the damage will
      increase, and when 5 or more are connected, the range will also increase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 214900857984352256
    m_Localized: Yuri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 214900860442214400
    m_Localized: 'These trash heaps will pay for what they''ve done.

      My arrows
      will bring them to justice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 214900862350622720
    m_Localized: 'Arrows rain down when there are enemies within range.

      The
      rain of arrows deals additional damage based on lost health.'
