  - m_Id: 228671880644517888
    m_Localized: Owlrus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 228671885862232064
    m_Localized: 'O dark sorcerer...

      Your darkness will not last long.

      The
      twilight storm will obliterate our enemies,

      and Orus... I shall be your
      salvation!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 228672112040075264
    m_Localized: 'You send the Twilight Storm to the farthest enemy on the field.

      Enemies
      in its path take damage proportional to their maximum health.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 228742750243119104
    m_Localized: Full HP Per Damage
