    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 229859986209341440
    m_Localized: 'The power of life is always with us.

      When this battle ends,
      peace will return once more.

      Don''t give up; the balance of nature will
      always be restored.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 229860227037888512
    m_Localized: 'When Flora is summoned or fused, you obtain one Water Droplet.

      Flora
      of 4-star rank or higher uses Nature''s Healing.

      Nature''s Healing restores
      cracked ice and provides a Bubble if there is no cracked ice.'
