  - m_Id: 342539024571015168
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations!

      Rewards have been paid for reaching the
      top of the Daily Rankings!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 342539024571015169
    m_Localized: Daily Rank Reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 342539024571015170
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations!

      Reward has been paid for ranker {0} the
      Daily Rankings!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 342539024571015171
    m_Localized: <size=27><color=#EA1F66> ( Ranker profile is available only during
      the Daily )</color></size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352357475868839936
    m_Localized: Cumulative draw 80 times to achieve new characters confirmed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352692721357262848
    m_Localized: "The moonlight doesn\u2019t touch me.\r\nbecause I\u2019m already
      in your shadow"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352692977486630912
    m_Localized: 'When even the wind holds its breath,

      the arrow finds the
      truth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352692990417670144
    m_Localized: 'Only those who endure the weight of the sword

      can become
      true protectors.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352693035837788160
    m_Localized: "Twilight isn\u2019t the end. For me,\r\nit\u2019s just the beginning."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352693057140658176
    m_Localized: 'Even steel softens when you treat

      it like a heart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352693085783560192
    m_Localized: Codename Chamy. Standing by.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
